  "That way, we can all contribute to a harmonious and productive work environment.",
  "While we guide and teach our mentees, we also learn from them and create a collaborative, inclusive dynamic.",
  "This way, everyone can contribute and feel a sense of belonging.",
  "Being aware of our biases is crucial.",
  "We should constantly challenge ourselves to step outside our comfort zones and embrace diverse ideas and experiences."
